  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "Tàn掉"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>邱丹霓</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">巷仔底&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hit扇紅色ê鐵門（muî）　是囡仔時ê記憶</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">提成績單行tuínn--去　分數你講無滿意</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">雄雄tsua̋nn pìnn面　自今仔日起　你免koh入門（muî）</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Phak tī門邊　一个囡仔phí　大聲huah-hiu　hōo我入--去</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tiô跤tuìnn蹄　拜託緊開門（muî）　kā我tàn掉　到底是為啥mi̍h</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">自tsia起&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">驚hông掛電話　驚hông sak--開</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">驚你　無講無tànn來離開　驚一下精神　就揣無你</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">因為驚</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kā心內ê聲　tsiâu禁掉　騙家己　委屈無算啥&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">無siá-sì　m̄敢哭出聲　別人歡喜　tsiah重要</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kan-na希望　mài kā我tàn掉</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><span><a name='more'></a></span><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><p></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgUCHfP9ZcxoO5pj47vRJ8D_G6bxhv3plnQQN-e6AaaV7unEvPASs6JtnS_YfwT_RbfUyKhnNnc91t4N0GHRtUweHrT7QqEi3hBJeU7LnLBlcNBTKNvTlMZH6fONUqYTV8-YYFIVqPLbfMjVDiifwVr7UalvYcBLsJ0zocr_JPM67l1OK6MvfPK1Ccycg/s1424/343%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgUCHfP9ZcxoO5pj47vRJ8D_G6bxhv3plnQQN-e6AaaV7unEvPASs6JtnS_YfwT_RbfUyKhnNnc91t4N0GHRtUweHrT7QqEi3hBJeU7LnLBlcNBTKNvTlMZH6fONUqYTV8-YYFIVqPLbfMjVDiifwVr7UalvYcBLsJ0zocr_JPM67l1OK6MvfPK1Ccycg/w450-h640/343%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjetEA96TIJrIsV_F_HuD1T458WNTaCLv143CPqYf31WBur-DBEREMUABRnuaAD8Ll4p6lsw5P4sc3FOi7H3drhha6ZS8pXmtAMSUDCwIqw3xHg-he4ofexQXQ6smjsm8B6xhU-psl7ByCYmi8SOWBr8OdbHCPn1jhZjEEaSMKruHt3r5-olrMIwE9r1w/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1343%E6%9C%9F_03.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjetEA96TIJrIsV_F_HuD1T458WNTaCLv143CPqYf31WBur-DBEREMUABRnuaAD8Ll4p6lsw5P4sc3FOi7H3drhha6ZS8pXmtAMSUDCwIqw3xHg-he4ofexQXQ6smjsm8B6xhU-psl7ByCYmi8SOWBr8OdbHCPn1jhZjEEaSMKruHt3r5-olrMIwE9r1w/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1343%E6%9C%9F_03.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><